# GitHub Releases (this repo)

Do **not** `git tag`, `git push`, or `gh release create` for a product release.
The agent cannot unlock the SSH key. Tag + GitHub Release are created by
`.github/workflows/release.yml` after a human **Actions → Release → Run workflow**.

When the user asks to выпусти релиз / пометь релизным / cut a GitHub Release:
read `.cursor/skills/prepare-github-release/SKILL.md` and run
`.github/scripts/Get-ReleaseMetadata.ps1`. Do not invent a second release path.

Skip a binary release for docs/rules-only trees. Local version bumps stay
independent of GitHub Releases (several bugfixes may share one dispatch).

CI shards (AnalyzerLifecycle vs unit, remainder filter): `.cursor/rules/roslyn-mcp-ci.mdc`.
Do not replace `test-suite.yml` with one sequential `dotnet test`.

Attest **Release zips only** (`actions/attest-build-provenance` on `publish` after
`New-PublishZip`, before `gh release create`). Do not attest CI TRX. Job
`publish` needs `id-token: write` and `attestations: write` in addition to
`contents: write`. This is provenance, not Authenticode.
